# Unfreeze of Asclepius for the KSP 1.12.x / v5.1.0 release.
# Leave Asclepius-clouds and ContractConfigurator-Asclepius frozen — those
# optional packs are not in the KSP 1.12 zip (no BoulderCo/ or ContractPacks/).
#
# Visual-stack note:
#   The sandstorm/atmosphere configs are :NEEDS-gated and work with EVE-Redux
#   (CKAN identifier EnvironmentalVisualEnhancements) and Scatterer.
#   They are also written for Blackrack's paid True Volumetric Clouds V5, which
#   is NOT on CKAN and bundles its own EVE-Redux + Scatterer. Recommending or
#   even suggesting the CKAN EVE/Scatterer modules would auto-offer (or, for
#   recommends, auto-install) copies that conflict with a V5 install.
#   Those identifiers are intentionally omitted. Deferred and Shabby are free
#   and on CKAN; Deferred already depends on Shabby, so only Deferred is
#   suggested (not recommended). Parallax / ParallaxContinued is not part of
#   this release.
#
# Keep x_netkan_epoch: 2 so the new release versions as 2:v5.1.0 (> 2:v5.0).
# $vref reads GameData/Asclepius/Asclepius.version from the v5.1.0 GitHub
# release zip (KSP 1.12.0–1.12.99).
identifier: Asclepius
name: Asclepius
abstract: >-
  A Kopernicus planet and its moon Kruel — an SSTO playground for KSP 1.12.x.
  Optional volumetric sandstorms and atmosphere are included as configs only;
  Blackrack V5 (paid, not on CKAN) or EVE-Redux and Scatterer are not bundled.
author: MrChumley
$kref: '#/ckan/github/MrChumley/Asclepius/asset_match/^Asclepius.*\.zip$'
$vref: '#/ckan/ksp-avc'
x_netkan_epoch: 2
license: CC0
resources:
  homepage: https://forum.kerbalspaceprogram.com/index.php?/topic/113949-*
  repository: https://github.com/MrChumley/Asclepius
tags:
  - config
  - planet-pack
depends:
  - name: ModuleManager
  - name: Kopernicus
    min_version: '2:release-1.12.0-46'
# Intentionally not recommending ContractConfigurator-FarOutContracts
# (frozen, last indexed for KSP 1.3).
suggests:
  - name: Deferred
  - name: DistantObject
install:
  - find: Asclepius
    install_to: GameData
